''Team up and face the mighty Royal Titans, a brand-new duo boss that will put your combat skills to the test!''

Before we kick things off, a quick note from us: we're aware that the Delve Boss rewards are top of mind right now for many of you. We've been discussing the best direction to take and you can expect an update from us later today. In the meantime, the team have worked hard to bring the Royal Titans to life, so we'd really like conversation to focus on these for now so we can see what you think!

==Blog Update - Wednesday, February 5th, 13:45 GMT==
Whoops! It's been an especially busy week and it looks like we left out a couple of last minute tweaks that you'll definitely want to hear more on.

Last week, we made a handful of small changes to Forestry that re-ignited conversations about things like event frequency and collection log entries in particular. From those conversations, we've gone ahead and made the following changes, which were included with today's game update:

* Forestry Event spawn chance has been increased by 20% on all trees.
* Drop rates for the Golden Pheasant Egg, Fox Whistle and Petal Garland have been adjusted to 1 in 30 from their respective events.
* The Golden Pheasant Egg and Fox Whistle can now be purchased from for Forestry Shop for 75,000 Anima Bark a piece.

Thanks for bearing with us, apologies for missing this one, and we hope you're enjoying the Royal Titans!

