==12th Birthday Event==
It’s time to celebrate 12 incredible years of Old School RuneScape! We’ve got a jam-packed lineup of nostalgic fun in the [http://discord.gg/OSRS OSRS Discord], and we want you to get involved.

===OSRS Birthday Cake Competition===
[[File:Royal Titans (6).jpg|thumb|400px|center|''If you can’t see the image above, click'[https://cdn.runescape.com/assets/img/external/oldschool/2025/newsposts/2025-02-05/Bdaycake.jpg here]!'']]

Time to equip some baking mitts and make the Lumbridge Cook proud! We're challenging the community to create the most epic OSRS-themed birthday cakes.

* Competition Dates: 09:00 on February 10th to 21:00 on February 17th (GMT)
* Where to Submit: Post your entries in the '''#birthday-cakes''' channel on Discord or in the pinned Reddit thread under Community Highlights on [https://www.reddit.com/r/2007scape/ r/2007scape.]

Our judge will narrow it down to three finalists, and the Twitch chat will vote live on stream to decide the ultimate winner!

Prizes include:

* A RuneScape Kingdoms board game!
* A RuneScape Cookbook!
* A year's worth of membership!

===Nostalgic Voting Countdown===
We'll also be hosting 12 days of OSRS nostalgic voting, starting Sunday, February 9th! Each day, a new question will be posted in the '''#nostalgic-countdown''' channel, leading up to our Big Birthday Livestream on February 20th. Join in, cast your vote, and relive some of the most memorable moments in OSRS history.

What was the scariest early-game experience? Dying to a dark wizard or getting ambushed by a highwayman? You decide!

===12 Years of Memories===
While you're at it, take a trip down memory lane with our #[https://discord.com/channels/324132423636090880/1333485487817756786 12years-of-memories] channel. Share your photos, videos, or stories of your most nostalgic RuneScape moments - whether it’s your first 99, an unforgettable PKing battle, or a long-lost adventure with friends.

===OSRS Tattoo Designs===
Thinking about getting an OSRS-inspired tattoo but need some inspiration? Mods Jerv (Concept Artist) & Skylark (Character Artist) are on the case! We've set up a [https://discord.com/channels/324132423636090880/1333487319218520127 #Tattoo-Suggestions] channel in Discord, where you can drop your ideas. Before the Birthday livestream on February 20th, the Mods will pick some favourites and bring them to life with custom sketches.

Get involved, celebrate with us, and let’s make this birthday one to remember!

